{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOB","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"約伯記","commonName":"約伯記","title":"約伯記","order":18,"numberOfChapters":42,"sha256":"c2a2c8075ced18ee889b1f748446fbcb0aedee74df3b48c741b4e887b9daec45","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":42,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOB/42.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1067},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["撒但再試探約伯"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["又有一天，上帝的眾子來侍立在耶和華面前，撒但也來在其中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["耶和華問撒但說：「你從哪裏來？」撒但回答說：「我從地上走來走去，往返而來。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和華問撒但說：「你曾用心察看我的僕人約伯沒有？地上再沒有人像他完全正直，敬畏上帝，遠離惡事。你雖激動我攻擊他，無故地毀滅他，他仍然持守他的純正。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["撒但回答耶和華說：「人以皮代皮，情願捨去一切所有的，保全性命。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["你且伸手傷他的骨頭和他的肉，他必當面棄掉你。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和華對撒但說：「他在你手中，只要存留他的性命。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["於是撒但從耶和華面前退去，擊打約伯，使他從腳掌到頭頂長毒瘡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["約伯就坐在爐灰中，拿瓦片刮身體。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他的妻子對他說：「你仍然持守你的純正嗎？你棄掉上帝，死了吧！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["約伯卻對她說：「你說話像愚頑的婦人一樣。噯！難道我們從上帝手裏得福，不也受禍嗎？」在這一切的事上約伯並不以口犯罪。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["三個朋友來安慰約伯"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["約伯的三個朋友－提幔人以利法、書亞人比勒達、拿瑪人瑣法－聽說有這一切的災禍臨到他身上，各人就從本處約會同來，為他悲傷，安慰他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他們遠遠地舉目觀看，認不出他來，就放聲大哭。各人撕裂外袍，把塵土向天揚起來，落在自己的頭上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他們就同他七天七夜坐在地上，一個人也不向他說句話，因為他極其痛苦。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOB/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOB/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOB/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}